title: Gembirth Affair
subtitle: A crisis in the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>?
new-page: true
view-if: collectivist_relation >= 30 and comintern_seen and year = 1928 and month >= 8 and month <= 10
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: wittorf_affair_seen = 1
tags: event

= Gembirth Affair

Our spies and contacts amongst the collectivists have brought news of a scandal engulfing the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> leadership. An associate of <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> chairman Ernst Halsmark, a <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> official named John Gembirth, is accused of embezzling campaign funds, diverting thousands of crowns for personal use, and Halsmark is accused of covering up the affair. The party's central committee considers this charge serious.

The Conciliators in the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, a faction opposed to the party's present hard-line policy, are said to have leaked this information to aid them in the intra-party struggle. Dissident collectivists in the Red Vanguard also have information about this affair, and are planning to publish it.

What should we do with this information?

- @publicize
- @nothing
- @secret

@publicize
title: We will publicize the scandal to damage the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> and Halsmark.
on-arrival: collectivist_relation -= 10; commons_collectivist -= 4; disfavored_collectivist -= 4

Our newspapers are among the first to publicize the affair, bringing a torment of criticism to the hypocrisy of the collectivists. We have damaged the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>'s standing among the workers, but also perhaps closed the door on further cooperation.

In the end, <span style="color: #8B0000;">Vessarion</span>'s pressure helps to keep Halsmark from facing much in the way of consequences.

@nothing
title: Do nothing with the information.
on-arrival: commons_collectivist -= 2; disfavored_collectivist -= 2

The information spreads without our help, leading to some loss of <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> support among the workers.


@secret
title: It is best to keep this information secret. Prevent the Red Vanguard and dissident <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> members from spreading this.
choose-if: levi_advisor or rosenfeld_advisor
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have contacts among the dissident collectivists.
on-arrival: wittorf_secret = 1; reformist_dissent += 5; left_dissent += 5

Some among our leadership consider it unsavory to engage in cloak-and-dagger scheming. However, keeping this secret might be necessary to work with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, and the information might become useful later.
